Subject: [PATCH 240/260] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0236

Only an owner or edit collaborator can wake a sleeping sandbox for a download, and the download waits for a managed relaunch to settle first, as upload does. The file menu no longer lets its clicks and keys reach the link underneath, the touch icon sits beside the link instead of inside it, the right-click hint shows on fine pointers only, and the tests cover each.
